# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in ONE of the Claude credentials. Load it with
#   uv run --env-file .env ...
# Waystation reads no file itself: uv puts these in the process environment,
# and ClaudeCode passes them into the sandbox by name.
#
# Leave the one you don't use commented out. An empty KEY= still sets the
# variable, and Claude Code prefers an API key over an OAuth token when both
# are set.

# From `claude setup-token` (uses your Claude subscription).
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# From the Anthropic Console (billed per token).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Rung 7 only (examples/bring_your_own_agent.py): from Cursor's dashboard.
# CURSOR_API_KEY=
